{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-04-12 13:00:00', 'title': 'COMED EV RALLY HELPS MAKE THE FUTURE (OF STEM) FEMALE', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WITH THE END OF THE SCHOOL YEAR IN SIGHT, COMED IS EXCITED FOR THE RETURN OF THE COMED EV RALLY, ITS SIGNATURE SUMMER PROGRAM TO SUPPORT MORE WOMEN IN SCIENCE, TECHNOLOGY, ENGINEERING AND MATH (STEM). YOUNG WOMEN IN ILLINOIS CAN APPLY TO PARTICIPATE IN THE ANNUAL COMPETITION, WHICH CHALLENGES TEENS TO BUILD AND RACE HIGH-TECH, ELECTRIC-POWERED GO-CARTS.'}